Third party filers. 25LSO-0114, 1.0
FISCAL NOTE
This bill contains an appropriation of $100,000 from the GENERAL FUND to the
Secretary of State's Office. This appropriation is effective immediately.
DETAIL OF APPROPRIATION
Agency #: 002 Agency Name: Secretary of State's Office
Unit: (new) Third party filers
EXPENDITURE BY SERIES AND YEAR FY 2025 FY 2026 FY 2027
