GENERAL FUND $100,000
Description of appropriation:
To accommodate the requirements in this bill, a new module for third-party filer
registrations must be developed in WyoSuite, including a form for recording
required details and payment, while paper and online filing systems need updates
to track and enforce registration requirements for compensated filers.
Additionally, automated notifications and reporting must be created to manage
filers approaching or exceeding the 10-document threshold, prohibiting further
filings without registration. The funds appropriated will be used for this
purpose.
This legislation requires third-party filers to pay an administrative fee not to
exceed $50. The revenue increase from this administrative fee is indeterminable.
The Secretary of State’s Office cannot predict how many people will register as
third-party filers at this time.
NOTICE-AGENCY ESTIMATE OF ADMINISTRATIVE IMPACT REQUESTED
